158	/* No test exercises rb_validate actually rejecting a bad tree (invariant 4 or 5):
159	 * struct rb_node/struct rbtree are opaque outside src/rbtree.c, and rb_insert cannot
160	 * produce a mis-ordered tree or a size/count mismatch by construction. That case has
161	 * to wait until a real bug (most likely in fixup, later) can manufacture one, which
162	 * the fuzzer's periodic rb_validate calls are designed to catch when it happens. */
